### Local Development Environment
### Run this when all services are started locally via ./scripts/run-all.sh
### Services run on:
###   - statement-service: http://localhost:8082
###   - analysis-service: http://localhost:8083
###   - recommendation-service: http://localhost:8084
###   - product-service: http://localhost:8085

@baseUrl = http://localhost

################################################################
### 1. STATEMENT SERVICE - Foundation Layer (Port 8082)
################################################################

### 1.1 Seed statement data
POST {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/seed
Content-Type: application/json

### 1.2 Get all statements for an account
GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/statements

### 1.3 Get a specific statement
GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/statements/stmt-2025-12

### 1.4 Get all transactions for an account (across all statements)
GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/transactions

### 1.5 Get transactions within a date range
GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/transactions?from=2025-01-01&to=2025-12-31

### 1.6 Add a new transaction to a statement
POST {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/statements/stmt-2025-12/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "txn-001",
  "date": "2025-01-15",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "merchant": "Coffee Shop",
  "category": "Food & Drink"
}


################################################################
### 2. PRODUCT SERVICE - Product Catalog (Port 8085)
################################################################

### 2.1 Get all products
GET {{baseUrl}}:8085/products

### 2.2 Seed some products
POST {{baseUrl}}:8085/products/seed


### 2.3 Get a specific product
GET {{baseUrl}}:8085/products/health_insurance_basic

### 2.4 Create/Update a product
POST {{baseUrl}}:8085/products/prod-custom-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "prod-custom-001",
  "productName": "Custom Savings Account",
  "category": "Savings",
  "description": "High-yield savings for frequent savers with competitive rates",
  "eligibility": "Customers with regular deposit patterns"
}


################################################################
### 3. ANALYSIS SERVICE - AI-Powered Analysis (Port 8083)
################################################################

### 3.1 Run analysis on a statement (triggers heuristic or agent mode)
### Query param: statementId (default: stmt-2025-12)
### Check application.conf for analysis.mode (heuristic or agent)
POST {{baseUrl}}:8083/accounts/acc-1001/analysis/run?statementId=stmt-2025-12
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.2 Get analysis summary (auto-runs if not cached)
GET {{baseUrl}}:8083/accounts/acc-1001/analysis/summary?statementId=stmt-2025-12


################################################################
### 4. RECOMMENDATION SERVICE - Product Recommendations (Port 8084)
################################################################

### 4.1 Get recommendations (depends on analysis from analysis-service)
### This endpoint calls: analysis-service → statement-service
### Shows how services work TOGETHER
GET {{baseUrl}}:8084/accounts/acc-1001/recommendations?statementId=stmt-2025-12


################################################################
### 5. CROSS-SERVICE FLOW DEMONSTRATIONS
################################################################

### SCENARIO A: Complete Flow from Recommendation
### 1. Client calls recommendation-service
### 2. Recommendation-service calls analysis-service
### 3. Analysis-service calls statement-service
### 4. Results flow back up the chain
###
### HTTP SEQUENCE:
### GET /accounts/acc-1001/recommendations?statementId=stmt-2025-12
###   └─> GET /accounts/acc-1001/analysis/summary?statementId=stmt-2025-12 (analysis-service)
###       └─> GET /accounts/acc-1001/statements/stmt-2025-12 (statement-service)

GET {{baseUrl}}:8084/accounts/acc-1001/recommendations?statementId=stmt-2025-12


### SCENARIO B: Direct Analysis Flow
### Test the analysis layer independently
### Calls statement-service internally

POST {{baseUrl}}:8083/accounts/acc-1001/analysis/run?statementId=stmt-2025-12


### SCENARIO C: Statement Foundation (No Dependencies)
### Test the lowest layer - statements exist independently

GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/statements/stmt-2025-12


################################################################
### 6. DATA INTEGRITY CHECK
################################################################

### 6.1 Verify statements exist
GET {{baseUrl}}:8082/accounts/acc-1001/statements

### 6.2 Verify analysis was computed
GET {{baseUrl}}:8083/accounts/acc-1001/analysis/summary?statementId=stmt-2025-12

### 6.3 Verify recommendations were generated
GET {{baseUrl}}:8084/accounts/acc-1001/recommendations?statementId=stmt-2025-12

### 6.4 Verify products are available
GET {{baseUrl}}:8085/products
